  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SV of start-up winners in IDC Holding Slovakia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&#x160;N v&#xed;&#x165;azov gruz&#xed;nskej start-up s&#xfa;&#x165;a&#x17e;e v IDC Holding Slovakia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;Cie&#x13e;om &#x161;tudijnej n&#xe1;v&#x161;tevy SR je st&#xe1;&#x17e; 5 mlad&#xfd;ch gruz&#xed;nskych start upistov v Holdingu IDC, kde sa bud&#xfa; u&#x10d;i&#x165; riadiacim a v&#xfd;robn&#xfd;m procesom priamo vo firme, ktor&#xe1; pre&#x161;la transform&#xe1;ciou zo socialistick&#xe9;ho podniku na &#xfa;spe&#x161;n&#xfd; podnik riadiaci sa trhov&#xfd;m mechanizmom. Gruz&#xed;nski podnikatelia uvidia, ako je mo&#x17e;n&#xe9; uplatni&#x165; nov&#xe9; n&#xe1;pady a inovat&#xed;vnos&#x165; vo firm&#xe1;ch roz&#x161;irova&#x165; podnik smerom k medzin&#xe1;rodn&#xfd;m dimenzi&#xe1;m.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The aim of the study visit was an internship of 5 Georgian Young start-up winners at IDC Holding, where they have learnt the management and production processes directly in the company, which has undergone a transformation from a socialist enterprise to a successful enterprise operating market mechanisms. Georgian businessmen will see how it is possible to apply new ideas and innovation in companies expand business towards international dimension.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
